---
import Mark from './Mark.astro';

const essay =
  'https://medium.com/@drensin/elephants-goldfish-and-the-new-golden-age-of-software-engineering-c33641a48874';
---

<section class="section" id="model">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="headline">Design with context. Review with fresh eyes.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        <a href="https://dkr.bio" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dave Rensin</a> introduces this
        approach in{' '}
        <a href={essay} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Elephants, Goldfish, and the New Golden Age of Software Engineering
        </a>
        . Drafting agents hold full repository context while reviewing subagents start with a blank
        slate to expose blind spots early.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pair">
      <article class="role">
        <Mark variant="elephant" class="glyph" />
        <h3 class="title">Elephant</h3>
        <p class="role-sub">Full context</p>
        <p class="muted">
          Deep-context agents load system history, architecture, component boundaries, and user
          journeys. The Elephant runs structured brainstorming, probes operational limits, and
          drafts the specification.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="role">
        <Mark variant="goldfish" class="glyph" />
        <h3 class="title">Goldfish</h3>
        <p class="role-sub">Zero context</p>
        <p class="muted">
          Stateless, isolated subagents read only the draft spec and live source code, without
          conversation bias. A Goldfish swarm stress-tests the design from conflicting perspectives
          before you write code.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="approval muted">
      You make the architectural decisions and approve the spec before implementation.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 32px clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pair {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .role {
    max-inline-size: 46ch;
  }

  .role .muted {
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .pair :global(.glyph) {
    inline-size: 56px;
    block-size: 56px;
    margin-block-end: 20px;
  }

  .role-sub {
    font: var(--md-sys-typescale-title-lg);
    letter-spacing: var(--md-sys-typescale-title-lg-tracking);
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
    margin-block: 2px 14px;
  }

  .approval {
    margin-block-start: 32px;
    max-inline-size: 70ch;
  }
</style>
